    {"id": "t3", "type": "text", "x": 595, "y": 90, "width": 190, "height": 80,
      "text": "Step 3: Select Tools\n\n• Subagents (opt-in)\n• Direct/Write tools\n• Custom tool groups\n  (all fetched from API)",
